{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31392","headline":"公子行 · 韩琮","name":"公子行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫袖长衫色，银蝉半臂花。\n带装盘水玉，鞍绣坐云霞。\n别殿承恩泽，飞龙赐渥洼。\n控罗青褭辔，镂象碧熏葩。\n意气倾歌舞，阑珊走钿车。\n袖障云缥缈，钗转凤欹斜。\n珠卷迎归箔，雕笼晃醉纱。\n唯无难夜日，不得似仙家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}